    "summaryKorean": "수유 중 Meloxicam 투여에 관한 NIH LactMed 공식 임상 요약 정보를 아래 영문 원문과 함께 확인하십시오.",
    "summaryOriginalEnglish": "Because no information is available on the use of meloxicam during breastfeeding, other agents may be preferred, especially while nursing a newborn or preterm infant.",
    "infantAdverseEffectsKorean": "개정일 기준 모유수유 영아에서 보고된 관련 이상반응 출판 문헌이 없습니다.",
    "infantAdverseEffectsOriginal": "Relevant published information was not found as of the revision date.",
    "ridOriginalText": null,
    "ridKoreanSummary": null,
    "drugLevelsOriginal": "Maternal Levels. Relevant published information was not found as of the revision date.\nInfant Levels. Relevant published information was not found as of the revision date.",
    "lactationEffectsOriginal": "Relevant published information was not found as of the revision date.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK501922/?term=Meloxicam",
